WEBVTT

00:16:54.897 --> 00:17:01.336
He walks the face of the Earth 
right now and knows why he's here.

00:17:01.342 --> 00:17:04.190
What a gift.

00:17:04.190 --> 00:17:06.821
The second thing that my son has given me

00:17:06.821 --> 00:17:09.876
is he's given me my mission in life.

00:17:09.876 --> 00:17:11.680
Now I know why I'm here.

00:17:11.680 --> 00:17:14.824
I'm going to save my son,

00:17:14.824 --> 00:17:17.614
and if it doesn't happen in time for him,

00:17:17.614 --> 00:17:20.256
I'm going to work so that no other mother

00:17:20.256 --> 00:17:23.815
has to go through what I'm going through.

00:17:23.815 --> 00:17:26.509
And the third thing, 
and last but not least

00:17:26.519 --> 00:17:29.546
gift that my son has given me,

00:17:29.546 --> 00:17:31.633
as an exclamation point